{"unit_id":"mldhao__dsh-conversation-strip#caveat-1","repo":"mldhao/dsh-conversation-strip","commit":"48a999090ccae018f75fdbfba3d2479983ea5bc6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-strip 将筛选、显示、间距、密度和动效偏好写入浏览器 localStorage；设置无效或不可读时会回退到默认值。见 lib/client.js:60-67。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:60-67"]}
